    "title": "Evander Watch Face",
    "description": "\u2605 <b>Evander Watch Face Watch Face is fully  Wear OS  supported</b>\r\n\r\nNEW!  Evander Watch Face for Wear OS is full of digital interactive functions.\r\nWatch Face contains a huge number and user-friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.\r\n\r\nThe watch face contains free and premium features. Premium features should be unlocked to use them.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605  DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 \r\n The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n<b>The watch face CAN NOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, Galaxy Watch, ...) or any other OS except WearOS </b>\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2605 <b>Evander Watch Face Watch Face is fully  Wear OS  supported</b><br><br>NEW!  Evander Watch Face for Wear OS is full of digital interactive functions.<br>Watch Face contains a huge number and user-friendly settings on the watch and the phone companion app.<br><br>The watch face contains free and premium features. Premium features should be unlocked to use them.<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605  DISCLAIMER:  \u2605\u2605\u2605 <br> The watch face is standalone app but the complication for phone battery requires a connection with the companion app on Android phone devices. iPhone users can not have this data due to iOS limitation.<br><br>\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b><br>!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! <br>richface.watch@gmail.com<br><br><b>The watch face CAN NOT be installed on smartwatches with TizenOS (Samsung Gear 2, 3, Galaxy Watch, ...) or any other OS except WearOS </b><br><br>\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained<br>https://www.richface.watch/privacy",
